diff --git a/changelog/69890.added.md b/changelog/69890.added.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..c065fce
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/69890.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Added support for "usage dropped below expected" alerts to the ``diskusage``
+beacon, alongside the existing "usage rose above threshold" alerts. A mount
+can now be configured with a mapping of ``above``/``below`` thresholds
+instead of a bare value, e.g. ``/mnt/nfs: {above: 90%, below: 5%}``, to catch
+a filesystem that silently failed to mount. Existing bare-threshold
+configuration is unaffected.
